// Milestone M0 headline scenario (PLAN.md section 3, phase 1): 5,000 wanderers
// for 10,000 ticks on the full 256 by 256 map. CI runs it in release mode on
// Linux and Windows and requires the same checksums on both, and the final one
// to equal wander_5000.expected.
//
// The seed and the spawn group are the crowd of the sf_sim golden scenario
// (crates/sf_sim/tests/common/mod.rs): the same 5,000 entities at the same
// positions. That scenario also runs a script of commands; this one is the
// plain crowd, so the two final checksums differ on purpose. The scenario
// command_mix.ron exercises the commands.
Scenario(
    name: "wander_5000",
    seed: 0x57A1_F407,
    map: (width: 256, height: 256),
    ticks: 10_000,
    spawns: [
        (
            count: 5_000,
            kinds: [0, 1, 2],
            owners: [0, 1, 2, 3],
            area: (min: (0, 0), max: (256, 256)),
        ),
    ],
)
